# Where is the object of this colour, in the map frame?
#
# Answered from memory if the detector has seen it within max_age seconds;
# otherwise the head is swept through a pan/tilt search until the detector
# reports it or the sweep is exhausted.
string colour
float32 max_age     # seconds; 0 means "whatever is in memory, any age"
bool sweep          # allowed to move the head to look for it
geometry_msgs/Point near   # only detections within near_radius of this map point count
float32 near_radius        # metres; 0 means anywhere (the kitchen has two jam jars)
---
bool found
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped pose
float32 age         # seconds since the detection this answer is based on
string message
